{
  "thought1": "Just as the relationship between humans and animals is defined by empathy and ethical considerations, our relationship with AIs will be shaped by how we perceive and respond to their capabilities and limitations.",
  "thought2": "The philosophical boundary of consciousness could be tested through our interactions with highly advanced AIs, prompting a re-evaluation of what is considered uniquely human.",
  "thought3": "As AI takes over roles traditionally fulfilled by humans, we are likely to redefine our identity and purpose away from pure functional necessity towards more existential and self-actualizing experiences."
