    "observation": "With advancing gender equality movements globally, society has started to dismantle some existing stereotypical gender roles. Both men and women are increasingly seen engaging in activities that have been traditionally associated with the opposite gender. Notably, we've seen shifts in men's willingness to engage in activities of caregiving and parenting, while women's participation in workforce leadership roles and tech-related fields has also increased."
